@startuml TBOT-Onboarding
title Domain · onboarding — pre-account intro & permissions
left to right direction

actor Guest
actor "Device OS" as OS <<external>>

package "onboarding" {
  usecase "View Splash"              as UC_ONB_SPLASH
  usecase "View Welcome"             as UC_ONB_WELCOME
  usecase "Run Intro Tutorial"       as UC_ONB_INTRO
  usecase "View Parent Trust Intro"  as UC_ONB_TRUST
  usecase "Grant Mic Permission"     as UC_ONB_MIC
  usecase "Enter First Lesson"       as UC_ONB_FIRST
}

Guest --> UC_ONB_SPLASH
Guest --> UC_ONB_WELCOME
Guest --> UC_ONB_INTRO
Guest --> UC_ONB_TRUST
Guest --> UC_ONB_MIC
Guest --> UC_ONB_FIRST

UC_ONB_SPLASH  ..> UC_ONB_WELCOME : <<auto-advance>>
UC_ONB_WELCOME ..> UC_ONB_INTRO   : "Get started"
UC_ONB_INTRO   ..> UC_ONB_TRUST   : <<auto-advance>>
UC_ONB_TRUST   ..> UC_ONB_MIC
UC_ONB_MIC     ..> OS : <<delegate>> permission sheet

note right of UC_ONB_FIRST
  [exit] → lesson-session : UC_LSN_START
end note

' [exit] login step → auth : UC_AUTH_LOGIN | UC_AUTH_SIGNUP
' Files: src/features/onboarding/*Page.jsx
@enduml
